&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jpzdscYk5cgQ7kNvwFeEzx5&_nc_oc=AdpLG1B7Si8CePEUhGQ25a7sWNIN13xvWWg7NoFKqYaWvHbb3EQmmOtBWgA_DdbKEyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMFGhbZfrGDlss-rkEYzKvOg8W3IQKWKyfIHZhYYF2NtA&oe=6AD39E0E"}, "display_name": "GRO", "keywords": ["Farming", "GAG", "Garden", "Game", "VR"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                       \n                                                    \n\n\nA farming adventure with GTAG movement. Celebrating 3 months of launch!\n{1961694904718240}\n# GRIND or RISK?\nComplete Harvests of the Day for ez money, OR risk EVERYTHING in Double or Nothing.\n# LIVE EVENTS AND EXCLUSIVE REWARD \nClaim free Welcome Rewards when you first open this update. Join live event Feed the Pond to earn the rarest seeds in the game - **Dollaranana**.\n{1471323561438861}\n# BUILD BUFFED GARDENS\nPlant magical seeds and harvest gigantic fruits. Mutate your crops with rare weathers like Aurora, Solar Flare, Fireworks. Now you can move plants with TROWEL!\n\n# BRAND NEW SKINS AND CURRENCY\nWe added cool new wardrobe with fresh skins and lots of customisations. Get all Fruit Friends skins for the ultimate collection.\n{2021170175493065}\n# Pets Coming Soon\nMagical creatures that help your garden to get mutations, grow bigger plants!\n\nBecome a **GRO BRO: https://discord.gg/gro**\n", "short_description": "Plant, Harvest, GRO-w!\n\nA fantasy farming sandbox, where cozy farming meets multiplayer chaos!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://grogame.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AutoVrse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://grogame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_cate